## TODO: conformance-test-suite

Scalability (test infrastructure). Small-Medium. Blocked on: game-registry (needs uniform
GameSpecs to parameterize over). Follows game-registry Stage 1.

Once every game is a uniform `GameSpec`, replace hand-written per-game tests with a suite
that is PARAMETERIZED over `GAME_REGISTRY`: write each invariant check once and run it for
every spec. Candidate universal checks: engine roundtrip (state save/read), target routing
(`target_for` returns the right ScanTarget per location tag), `disabled_suffix` /
`priority_prefix_enabled` consistency with the ModUnit, and a detection sanity check.
Keep game-specific behavior tests (crimeboss_settings, pdmod, RAID marker parsing) as their
own targeted tests - the parameterized suite covers the uniform contract, not the novel 20%.
Net effect: adding a family-conforming game gets test coverage for free.

